  "body": "Think you’re priced out of the Eastern Bays? Think again. With an overseas departure finalized, the owner is clear: bring an offer, sell the home. This is your chance to leapfrog into Auckland's premier coastal suburb at entry-level pricing.\r\n\r\nLocated in the quiet Mews section of 'The Outlook', this sun-soaked 1-bedroom apartment offers a designer lifestyle without the hefty price tag:\r\n\r\n• Sun & Space: Bathed in northern sun with premium finishes throughout.\r\n\r\n• Turnkey Living: Forget weekend chores, building maintenance and insurance are fully managed, and low Body Corporate fees keep your expenses minimal.\r\n\r\n• The Full Package: Comes complete with your own secure carpark and extra storage.\r\n\r\n• Lifestyle Upgrade: Supermarket, cafes, and shops right across the road at Eastridge, with the beach at the end of the hill.\r\n\r\nSerious opportunities like this don't wait around. Skip the compromise and step into Mission Bay today. Call immediately for a private viewing!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
